eriential Learning Internships Jackson Scholars Program Scott Scholars Program Study Abroad Your Four Years at Hastings The Arts Close The Arts Open The Arts Fine Arts at Hastings Art Music Band / Instrumental Music Choir / Choral Music Speech (Forensics) Theatre Fine Arts & Public Events Calendar Jackson Scholars Program Open Space at Hastings College Talent Scholarships Athletics Close Athletics Open Athletics HastingsBroncos.com It’s a Great Day to Be a Bronco! Athletics Schedule Bronco Booster Club Alumni Close Alumni Open Alumni Together Tuesday Ways to Give Give Today The Ringland Society Planned Giving Stay Connected Alumni Events Homecoming Alumni Services Refer a Student Alumni and Donor Portal Contact Us Alumni/Foundation Staff Foundation Board Student Life Close Student Life Open Student Life Life at Hastings Housing Dining on Campus Getting Around Campus Health, Safety & Wellness About Hastings, Nebraska Student Services Student Engagement / Academic Affairs Staff Search Career Services Your transition from college to a career begins your first semester at Hastings College, as every internship, volunteer service, part time job, research study and extracurricular activity has the potential to add to your experience and employability. For the student worker job board, career and internship support, including applying for internship credit, click the button below. ourHC Page Hastings College Career Services staff are here to help and provide guidance when you’re seeking information about careers, summer jobs, internships, graduate school and full-time employment. Services include Alumni Mentoring, on-campus employment, CPT/OPT, career fairs, career counseling and assessment; part-time, summer and full-time job listings; career readiness workships; resume, interview and job search preparation. Nervous about an interview? Make an appointment for a mock interview and go in with confidence! We can also help connect you to our  wonderful alumni network ! Are you an employer looking to offer an internship, part job or full-time employment for a Hastings College student? Click here for more . Career Services Staff Carissa Uhrmacher Director of Career Services 402.461.7400 carissa.uhrmacher@hastings.edu Cecilia Velarde Assistant Director of Career Services 402.461.7387 cecilia.velarde1@hastings.edu Connect With Us For our latest news and job openings, follow us on these social media accounts. Facebook . Instagram Office Hours and Location We are in the lower level of the Daugherty Student Engagement Center ( map ). Office hours are 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m., Monday through Friday. After-hours meetings are available by appointment. Life at Hastings Chapel and Ministry Clubs and Organizations Student Association Intramurals Dining on Campus Housing Student Services Academic Counseling and Studio 200 Accessibility / Disability Services Career Services Student Handbook Student Ambassador Association Health, Safety & Wellness Campus Safety Fitness Center Health Services Student Counseling Getting Around Campus About Hastings, Nebraska Internship Stories Huxtable grows giant pumpkins and a lasting legacy August 31, 2026 As fall approaches, Tom Huxtable ’73 has five enormous pumpkins growing in a patch three blocks from his home. The largest already weighs 470 pounds. During this peak growing season, its weight increases by as much as 30 pounds a day, making it a bit of a public spectacle in Lake City, Michigan, population 830. […] ... Read More » Hastings College wildlife biology major fights wildfires with U.S. Forest Service August 18, 2026 Wildfires are dangerous, unpredictable and capable of changing in seconds. While most people picture engines rolling toward a fire, Hastings College wildlife biology major Jaedyn Adler drops directly into the blaze by helicopter. Armed with only what he can carry, the senior and his crew are tasked with containing the fire until backup arrives. This […] ... Read More » Johnson gains corporate customer service skills with summer internship August 11, 2026 Destini Johnson has always been interested in working with people. She began as a barista, and over the summer moved into a new role thanks to an internship with Enterprise Mobility in Grand Island, Nebraska. Johnson, a business administration major from Frederick, Colorado, attended a career fair hosted by Hastings College’s Career Services team in […] ... Read More » Video: Kammerer, biology education grad, found her place at Hastings College August 11, 2026 Molly Kammerer of Sutherland, Nebraska, felt like she could do anything at Hastings College. “The people who saw me, loved me and helped me, and pushed me to be the self that I am today,” she said. Kammerer, who graduated in May as a teacher with a biology endorsement, said, “My place mattered because I […] ... Read More » Hastings College senior T’Nae Young brings empathy to juvenile probation July 16, 2026 Hastings College student T’Nae Young has always been fascinated by criminal psychology, from her love of crime shows as a child to her internship at District 10 Probation in Hastings, where she has found herself putting juvenile delinquents back on the right path. Young, a senior criminology and psychology double major from the Bahamas, applied […] ... Read More » Fuqua opens hearts to animals at Heartland Pet Connection July 16, 2026 Claire Fuqua began their journey to becoming an animal care technician by rescuing a stray kitten — taking the cat to Heartland Pet Connection in Hastings and picking up a job application in the process. Fuqua, a wildlife biology and philosophy & religion double major from Woodland Park, Colorado, received an acceptance call the day […] ... Read More » ourHC Email Calendar Spirit Shop Library Careers Quicklinks ourHC Email Calendar Spirit Shop Library Careers Quicklinks Hastings College | 800-532-7642 | 710 N. Turner Ave. | Hastings, Nebraska 68901 📍 Map / Directions Facebook-f Youtube Tiktok Instagram Linkedin-in Copyright 2026 Hastings College  | Hastings College is an equal opportunity employer & educator. | Title IX/HC Cares Start typing and press enter to search Search... Search Search"
